Design & Upgrades: Unlike the blockier Mark XLIV from Age of Ultron, the Mark XLVIII has a much sleeker, curved profile inspired by Tony's newer nanotech designs. It runs on multiple Arc Reactors spread across the chest, back, and limbs to drive its massive hydraulic limbs.

Pilot Setup: It was redesigned to be far more user-friendly for non-Tony pilots. It features a HUD system calibrated to guide someone with zero flight experience.

MCU Appearance: During Avengers: Infinity War, Bruce Banner—unable to transform into the Hulk—pilots the suit during the Battle of Wakanda. He uses its sheer strength to tear through waves of Outriders and ultimately kills Cull Obsidian by attaching a detached gauntlet to him and launching him into the Wakandan energy shield.
